    "text": "<p>The position of the centre of mass of a uniform semi-circular wire of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> placed in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></math> plane with its centre at the origin and the line joining its ends as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"bottom\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></menclose><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
